       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CUSTMAINT.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-CUST-NO         PIC 9(8).
       01 WS-CUST-NAME       PIC X(30).
       01 WS-ACTIVE-FLAG     PIC X.
       01 WS-STATUS-MSG      PIC X(20).
       01 WS-NEVER-SCREENED  PIC X(5).

       SCREEN SECTION.
       01 CUST-SCREEN.
           02 BLANK SCREEN.
           02 LINE 1 COLUMN 1 VALUE "CUSTOMER MAINTENANCE" HIGHLIGHT.
           02 LINE 3 COLUMN 1  VALUE "Cust No:".
           02 LINE 3 COLUMN 15 PIC 9(8) USING WS-CUST-NO.
           02 LINE 5 COLUMN 1  VALUE "Name:".
           02 LINE 5 COLUMN 8  PIC X(30) USING WS-CUST-NAME.
           02 LINE 7 COLUMN 1  VALUE "Active:".
           02 LINE 7 COLUMN 10 PIC X USING WS-ACTIVE-FLAG REQUIRED.
           02 LINE 9 COLUMN 1  VALUE "Status:".
           02 LINE 9 COLUMN 10 PIC X(20) FROM WS-STATUS-MSG.
           02 LINE PLUS 2 COLUMN PLUS 1 VALUE "Last updated:".

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           DISPLAY CUST-SCREEN.
           ACCEPT CUST-SCREEN.
           STOP RUN.
